{
  "query": "A smart building platform named Lumina Facilities wants to drive lighting schedules, ventilation setpoints, and cleaning dispatches using live telemetry from 60,000 IoT sensors across multiple sites. You need a fully managed data solution that scales widely, supports a multicloud strategy, and provides low latency for device reads and writes. Which solution should you implement?",
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Cloud Spanner with Looker Studio",
      "explanation": "Cloud Spanner is a globally distributed relational database that scales horizontally and Looker Studio can visualize its data through connectors",
      "correct": false,
      "selected": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Bigtable with Looker Studio",
      "explanation": "Bigtable is a high throughput wide column store optimized for time series ingestion and Looker Studio can connect through supported integrations",
      "correct": false,
      "selected": false
    },
    {
      "text": "MongoDB Atlas with Charts",
      "explanation": "MongoDB Atlas is a managed NoSQL service that supports multicloud deployments and Charts provides native dashboards for stored data",
      "correct": true,
      "selected": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL with Looker Studio",
      "explanation": "Cloud SQL offers a managed PostgreSQL database for transactional workloads and Looker Studio can query it for reporting",
      "correct": false,
