  "tip": "<p>Map hard requirements to product capabilities. If you see a <i>multicloud</i> requirement, eliminate cloud specific services even if they scale well. For massive IoT with <i>low latency</i> device writes, prefer distributed NoSQL with global or multi cloud deployment options.</p>",
